  "css": "@layer base {\n  * {\n    @apply border-border outline-ring/50;\n  }\n  body {\n    @apply bg-background text-foreground font-mono;\n  }\n  ::selection {\n    @apply bg-foreground text-background;\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n    background: var(--background1);\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n    background: var(--foreground2);\n  }\n  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n    background: var(--foreground1);\n  }\n}",
  "docs": "Terminal-inspired theme with JetBrains Mono font, no shadows, sharp borders (0px radius), and full ANSI color palette (16 colors). Designed for clean, minimalist terminal-like interfaces."
